<view class="page">
  <view class="hero-card parent-hero card">
    <text class="hero-label">家长 5 分钟行动报告</text>
    <text class="hero-title">看孩子为什么卡住，而不是翻聊天记录。</text>
    <text class="hero-subtitle">
      反馈来自本次做题过程、错因和提示记录，家长不用翻完整对话也能看懂。
    </text>
    <view class="scope-row child-row">
      <block wx:for="{{children}}" wx:key="child_id">
        <button
          class="scope-button {{childId === item.child_id ? 'scope-button-active' : ''}}"
          data-child-id="{{item.child_id}}"
          bindtap="handleChildChange"
        >
          {{item.name}}
        </button>
      </block>
    </view>
    <view class="period-field">
      <text class="period-label">报告周期</text>
      <picker
        mode="selector"
        range="{{reviewScopeOptions}}"
        value="{{reviewScopeIndex}}"
        bindchange="handleScopePickerChange"
      >
        <view class="period-picker">
          <text>{{reviewScopeLabel}}</text>
          <text class="period-caret">⌄</text>
        </view>
      </picker>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-card action-error-card">
    <text class="error-title">报告暂时生成不了</text>
    <text class="error-text">{{error}}</text>
    <view class="button-row error-actions">
      <button class="button-primary" bindtap="handleRetry" loading="{{loading}}">
        重试生成报告
      </button>
      <button class="button-secondary" bindtap="handleOpenSettings">
        去设置
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{artifactMessage}}" class="state-card">{{artifactMessage}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state-card">正在汇总学习证据...</view>

  <view wx:if="{{parentConclusionItems.length}}" class="input-card card conclusion-card">
    <view class="section-header-line">
      <text class="section-title">本期结论</text>
      <text class="chip">{{reviewScopeLabel}}</text>
    </view>
    <block wx:for="{{parentConclusionItems}}" wx:key="title">
      <view class="insight-row">
        <text class="insight-label">{{item.label}}</text>
        <text class="wrong-title">{{item.title}}</text>
        <text class="section-text">{{item.text}}</text>
      </view>
    </block>
    <view wx:if="{{summaryStats.length}}" class="compact-metrics">
      <view wx:for="{{summaryStats}}" wx:key="label" class="compact-metric">
        <text class="metric-value">{{item.value}}</text>
        <text class="metric-label">{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{parentActionItems.length}}" class="input-card card action-card">
    <view class="section-header-line">
      <text class="section-title">行动建议</text>
      <text class="chip chip-accent">{{reviewScopeLabel}}</text>
    </view>
    <block wx:for="{{parentActionItems}}" wx:key="title">
      <view class="review-card">
        <text class="insight-label">{{item.label}}</text>
        <text class="wrong-title">{{item.title}}</text>
        <text class="wrong-meta">{{item.text}}</text>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{weaknessCards.length}}" class="input-card card weakness-card">
    <view class="section-header-line">
      <text class="section-title">薄弱点</text>
      <text class="chip">长期观察</text>
    </view>
    <block wx:for="{{weaknessCards}}" wx:key="title">
      <view class="memory-card">
        <text class="wrong-title">{{item.title}}</text>
        <text class="wrong-meta">{{item.text}}</text>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{safetyEvents.length}}" class="input-card card">
    <view class="section-header-line">
      <text class="section-title">安全拦截记录</text>
      <text class="chip chip-danger">孩子保护</text>
    </view>
    <block wx:for="{{safetyEvents}}" wx:key="safety_event_id">
      <view class="safety-card">
        <text class="wrong-title">{{item.reason}}</text>
        <text class="wrong-meta">{{item.event_type}}</text>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="input-card card">
    <view class="section-header-line">
      <text class="section-title">最近错题</text>
      <text class="chip chip-accent">可追溯</text>
    </view>
    <text wx:if="{{!recentWrongCards.length}}" class="section-text">
      还没有错题记录。孩子完成一次错题引导后，这里会出现过程证据。
    </text>
    <block wx:for="{{recentWrongCards}}" wx:key="questionId">
      <view class="wrong-card">
        <text class="wrong-title">{{item.questionText}}</text>
        <text class="wrong-meta">{{item.meta}}</text>
        <button
          class="resolve-button"
          data-question-id="{{item.questionId}}"
          bindtap="handleMarkResolved"
          disabled="{{loading}}"
        >
          标记已掌握
        </button>
        <button
          wx:if="{{experimentalFeaturesEnabled}}"
          class="resolve-button"
          data-question="{{item.questionText}}"
          data-knowledge-point="{{item.knowledgePoint}}"
          bindtap="handleGenerateDiagram"
          disabled="{{loading}}"
        >
          生成图解卡
        </button>
        <button
          wx:if="{{experimentalFeaturesEnabled}}"
          class="resolve-button"
          data-question="{{item.questionText}}"
          data-knowledge-point="{{item.knowledgePoint}}"
          bindtap="handleRequestAnimation"
          disabled="{{loading}}"
        >
          生成动态图解
        </button>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>
</view>
